# zcli apps:package / apps:server zip everything under the app root that is not
# listed here (dotfiles excluded). The app root is the repository root, so the
# backend, its node_modules and any local config would otherwise be uploaded to
# Zendesk. Directory entries need /** to match their contents.
backend/**
docs/**
scripts/**
tools/**
tmp/**
*.md
*.zip
package.json
package-lock.json
zcli.apps.config.json
zcli.apps.config.json.example
settings.json
LICENSE
